  "promptEs": "Lead sheet en Fa mayor. ¿Qué shell voicing realiza el cifrado Dm7 del compás 2?",
  "promptEn": "Lead sheet in F major. Which shell voicing realizes the Dm7 symbol in bar 2?",
  "explanationEs": "La respuesta correcta es «Re3 + Do4 + Fa4». Dm7 se construye Re–Fa–La–Do; el shell deja Re3 abajo y las guías Do4 (séptima) y Fa4 (tercera) arriba. Si tocás Re–Fa–La tenés la tríada sin séptima; si tocás Re–La–Do omitís la tercera y el acorde pierde su carácter menor.",
  "explanationEn": "The correct answer is “D3 + C4 + F4”. Dm7 is built from D–F–A–C; the shell leaves D3 at the bottom and the guide tones C4 (seventh) and F4 (third) above. If you play D–F–A you have the triad without the seventh; if you play D–A–C you omit the third and the chord loses its minor colour.",
  "difficulty": 3,
